          "title": "3. Key Academic Principles: Bohr Model of Hydrogen Atom, Quantized Radii and Energy Levels",
          "contentMarkdown": "Bohr Radii: r_n = a_0 * n^2 / Z, where a_0 = 52.9 pm (0.529 Angstrom).",
